@* Marks a legal page as a template that has not been reviewed by counsel. Must stay visible until a lawyer has approved the text. *@
<div class="mk-note mk-note-warn" role="note" data-testid="draft-notice">
    <MkIcon Name="alert" Size="20" />
    <p><strong>Draft template.</strong> This text is a starting point and has <strong>not been reviewed by a lawyer</strong>. Items in [square brackets] must be completed. Have it reviewed by counsel for your country and use case before you rely on it or publish it as final.</p>
</div>
